ariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p